          <p source="#source-7275-7331"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7275-7287"><rb>彼</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7287-7302">れを読み、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7302-7314"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7314-7331">れを読み、</seg></p>
