          <p source="#source-7425-7484"><seg source="#source-7425-7431">座を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7431-7446"><rb>繞</rb><rt>めぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7446-7455">る古き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7455-7479"><rb>巻巻</rb><rt>まきまき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7479-7484">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-7484-7609"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7484-7508"><rb>客人</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-7508-7577"><lem>まらうど</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-7559-7571">まろうど</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7577-7609">よ、これを見たまへ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-7609-7671"><seg source="#source-7609-7621">秋の野の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7621-7633"><rb>臥</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7633-7636">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7636-7648"><rb>猪</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7648-7651">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7651-7666"><rb>床</rb><rt>とこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7666-7671">の</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-7671-7707"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7671-7686"><rb>萩</rb><rt>はぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7686-7707">の花とも。</seg></p>
