        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-9208-9279"><seg source="#source-9208-9214">わが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9214-9226"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9226-9229">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9229-9244"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9244-9247">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9247-9277"><rb>常日頃</rb><rt>つねひごろ</rt></ruby></p>
          <p source="#source-9279-9344"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9279-9300"><rb>三人</rb><rt>みたり</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9300-9321"><rb>四人</rb><rt>よたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9321-9344">とつれだちぬ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9344-9405"><seg source="#source-9344-9362">また時として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9362-9374"><rb>唯</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9374-9377">だ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9377-9398"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9398-9405">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9405-9464"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9405-9426"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9426-9438"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9438-9464">く日も華やかに、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9464-9535"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9464-9485"><rb>三人</rb><rt>みたり</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9485-9506"><rb>四人</rb><rt>よたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9506-9509">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9509-9521"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9521-9535">くときは</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9535-9584"><seg source="#source-9535-9553">更にこころの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9553-9571"><rb>楽</rb><rt>たのし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9571-9584">めり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9584-9652"><seg source="#source-9584-9593">我等は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9593-9605"><rb>選</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9605-9614">りぬ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9614-9629"><rb>己</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9629-9632">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9632-9647"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9647-9652">、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9652-9720"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9652-9667"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9667-9682">すぢなれど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9682-9697"><rb>己</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9697-9700">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9700-9715"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9715-9720">、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-9720-9783"><seg source="#source-9720-9741">けはしけれども</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9741-9756"><rb>己</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9756-9759">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9759-9774"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9774-9783">。</seg></p>
