          <p source="#source-23134-23166"><seg source="#source-23134-23166">呼び掛くること無く、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-23166-23210"><seg source="#source-23166-23187">しばらくして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23187-23202"><rb>円</rb><rt>まる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23202-23210">き月</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-23210-23266"><seg source="#source-23210-23216">波に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23216-23231"><rb>跳</rb><rt>をど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23231-23243">りつれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23243-23255"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23255-23266">ひぬ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-23266-23313">「長き<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23275-23290"><rb>竿</rb><rt>さを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23290-23293">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23293-23305"><rb>欲</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23305-23313">し、</seg></p>
