        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-24151-24204"><seg source="#source-24151-24157">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24157-24172"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24172-24184">をずつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24184-24196"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24196-24204">くと</seg></p>
