        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-24557-24586"><seg source="#source-24557-24586">空には七月の太陽、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-24586-24636"><seg source="#source-24586-24604">白い壁と白い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24604-24622"><rb>河岸</rb><rt>かし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24622-24636">通りには</seg></p>
