          <p source="#source-24680-24727"><seg source="#source-24680-24707">どこかで鋼鉄の板を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24707-24722"><rb>叩</rb><rt>たゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24722-24727">く</seg></p>
