          <p source="#source-24812-24850"><seg source="#source-24812-24818">快い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24818-24845"><rb>南風</rb><rt>みなみかぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24845-24850">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-24850-24885"><seg source="#source-24850-24856">窓の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24856-24868"><rb>直</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24868-24885">ぐ下の潮は</seg></p>
