        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-25513-25572"><seg source="#source-25513-25522">そこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25522-25540"><rb>椿</rb><rt>つばき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25540-25543">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25543-25564"><rb>木隠</rb><rt>こがく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25564-25572">れて</seg></p>
