          <p source="#source-25753-25800"><seg source="#source-25753-25762">じつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25762-25777"><rb>黙</rb><rt>もだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25777-25800">してある身にも</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-25800-25835"><seg source="#source-25800-25835">似るか、素直な春の風、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-25835-25883"><seg source="#source-25835-25841">赤い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25841-25853"><rb>笑</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25853-25883">まひが先に立つ。</seg></p>
