          <p source="#source-26479-26535"><seg source="#source-26479-26491">なみなみ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26491-26503"><rb>注</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26503-26509">げる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26509-26530"><rb>杯</rb><rt>さかづき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26530-26535">を</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-26535-26591"><seg source="#source-26535-26544">眺めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26544-26559"><rb>眸</rb><rt>まみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26559-26562">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26562-26577"><rb>湿</rb><rt>うる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26577-26591">むとは、</seg></p>
