          <p source="#source-26709-26765"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26709-26724"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26724-26736">なる酒は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26736-26751"><rb>淡</rb><rt>うす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26751-26765">くとも、</seg></p>
