          <p source="#source-59482-59529"><seg source="#source-59482-59509">いつまでも若き日の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-59509-59524"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-59524-59529">く</seg></p>
