          <p source="#source-62472-62504"><seg source="#source-62472-62504">一切の因襲を超えて、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-62504-62554"><seg source="#source-62504-62525">自由と愛に生き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62525-62537"><rb>得</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62537-62554">ることを、</seg></p>
