          <p source="#source-68275-68321"><seg source="#source-68275-68284">一度に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68284-68299"><rb>呻</rb><rt>うめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68299-68321">く時が来た。</seg></p>
