          <p source="#source-68374-68409"><seg source="#source-68374-68409">生みの悩みの時が来た。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-68409-68453"><seg source="#source-68409-68415">荒い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68415-68436"><rb>血汐</rb><rt>ちしほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68436-68453">の洗礼で、</seg></p>
