          <p source="#source-69938-69991"><seg source="#source-69938-69962">後ろから来る女の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69962-69986"><rb>一列</rb><rt>いちれつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69986-69991">、</seg></p>
