          <p source="#source-70826-70870"><seg source="#source-70826-70835">生きた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-70835-70862"><rb>天鵝絨</rb><rt>びろうど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-70862-70870">よ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-70870-70910"><seg source="#source-70870-70910">憎からぬ黒猫の手ざはり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-70910-70942"><seg source="#source-70910-70942">ねむたげな黒猫の目、</seg></p>
