        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-71255-71308"><seg source="#source-71255-71308">競馬の馬の打勝たんとする鋭さならで</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71308-71367"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71308-71332"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71332-71347">の馬は我を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71347-71359"><rb>棄</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71359-71367">てし</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71367-71419"><seg source="#source-71367-71376">服従の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71376-71397"><rb>素速</rb><rt>すばや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71397-71419">き気転なり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71419-71481"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71419-71443"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71443-71452">の馬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71452-71464"><rb>痩</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71464-71481">せたるは、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71481-71588"><seg source="#source-71481-71496">競馬の馬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71496-71514"><rb>逞</rb><rt>たくま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71514-71520">しく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71520-71535"><rb>美</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71535-71544">くしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71544-71568"><rb>優形</rb><rt>やさがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71568-71588">と異なりぬ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71588-71640"><seg source="#source-71588-71594">常に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71594-71609"><rb>飢</rb><rt>ひも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71609-71618">じきが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71618-71630"><rb>為</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71630-71640">め。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71640-71708"><seg source="#source-71640-71661">競馬の馬もいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71661-71676"><rb>稀</rb><rt>まれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71676-71679">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71679-71694"><rb>鞭</rb><rt>むち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71694-71708">を受く。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71708-71809"><seg source="#source-71708-71717">されど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71717-71732"><rb>寧</rb><rt>むし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71732-71744">ろ求めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71744-71759"><rb>鞭</rb><rt>むち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71759-71786">打たれ、その刺戟に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71786-71801"><rb>跳</rb><rt>をど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71801-71809">る。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71809-71954"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71809-71833"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71833-71842">の馬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71842-71857"><rb>爛</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71857-71863">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71863-71875"><rb>癒</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71875-71881">ゆる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71881-71893"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71893-71899">なき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71899-71923"><rb>打傷</rb><rt>うちきず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71923-71926">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71926-71941"><rb>何</rb><rt>いづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71941-71954">れぞ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-71954-72010"><seg source="#source-71954-71972">競馬の馬と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71972-71996"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71996-72010">の馬と、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-72010-72111"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72010-72028"><rb>偶</rb><rt>たまた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72028-72031">ま</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72031-72046"><rb>市</rb><rt>いち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72046-72049">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72049-72076"><rb>大通</rb><rt>おほどほり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72076-72079">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72079-72091"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72091-72111">き会ひし時、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-72111-72175"><seg source="#source-72111-72175">競馬の馬はその同族の堕落を見て涙ぐみぬ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-72175-72252"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72175-72199"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72199-72220">の馬は泣くべき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72220-72238"><rb>暇</rb><rt>いとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72238-72252">も無し、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-72252-72341"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72252-72276"><rb>慳貪</rb><rt>けんどん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72276-72282">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72282-72306"><rb>黒奴</rb><rt>くろんぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72306-72309">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72309-72333"><rb>曲馬</rb><rt>きよくば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72333-72341">師は</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-72341-72449"><seg source="#source-72341-72368">広告のため、楽隊の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72368-72383"><rb>囃</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72383-72389">しに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72389-72401"><rb>伴</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72401-72413">れて彼を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72413-72428"><rb>歩</rb><rt>あゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72428-72449">ませぬ……</seg></p>
