          <p source="#source-79434-79474"><seg source="#source-79434-79449">駆け登つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79449-79461"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79461-79474">く人。</seg></p>
