          <p source="#source-83506-83580"><seg source="#source-83506-83521">よれよれの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83521-83536"><rb>皺</rb><rt>しは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83536-83545">の波、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83545-83569"><rb>酒染</rb><rt>さかじみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83569-83580">の雲、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-83580-83662"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83580-83601"><rb>煙草</rb><rt>たばこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83601-83604">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83604-83628"><rb>焼痕</rb><rt>やけあと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83628-83631">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83631-83649"><rb>霰</rb><rt>あられ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83649-83662">模様。</seg></p>
