          <p source="#source-83730-83828"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83730-83745"><rb>衣</rb><rt>きぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83745-83748">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83748-83763"><rb>透</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83763-83769">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83769-83790"><rb>乾物</rb><rt>ひもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83790-83793">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83793-83808"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83808-83828">く骨だちぬ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-83828-83922"><seg source="#source-83828-83852">背丈の高きは冬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83852-83873"><rb>老木</rb><rt>おいき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83873-83897">のむきだしなるが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83897-83912"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83912-83922">し。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-83922-84048"><seg source="#source-83922-83940">ぐれんどうの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83940-83958"><rb>命</rb><rt>みこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-83958-83961">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-83961-84028"><rb><seg source="#source-83961-83964">顳</seg><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-6" source="#source-83964-84010">顬</g></rb><rt>こめかみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84028-84048">は音楽なり、</seg></p>
