          <p source="#source-84125-84192"><seg source="#source-84125-84158">どす黒く青き筋肉の蛇の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84158-84173"><rb>節</rb><rt>ふし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84173-84192">廻し………</seg></p>
