          <p source="#source-84579-84676"><seg source="#source-84579-84591">きちがひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84591-84609"><rb>茄子</rb><rt>なす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84609-84618">の夢の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84618-84633"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84633-84642">く過ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84642-84657"><rb>給</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84657-84676">ふ神なり。</seg></p>
