          <p source="#source-104442-104498"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104442-104457"><rb>種</rb><rt>しゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104457-104460">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104460-104472"><rb>殖</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104472-104478">やす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104478-104493"><rb>外</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104493-104498">に</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-104498-104552"><seg source="#source-104498-104519">恋愛を知らない</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104519-104543"><rb>蟷螂</rb><rt>かまきり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104543-104552">。</seg></p>
