        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-104619-104663"><seg source="#source-104619-104637">もう、玉虫の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104637-104658"><rb>一対</rb><rt>つがひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104658-104663">を</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-104663-104728"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104663-104684"><rb>綺麗</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104684-104728">な手箱に飼ふ娘もありません。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-104728-104772"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104728-104758"><rb>青磁色</rb><rt>せいじいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104758-104772">の流行が</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-104772-104840"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104772-104787"><rb>廃</rb><rt>すた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104787-104802">れたよりも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-104802-104817"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-104817-104840">しい事ですね。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-104840-104878"><seg source="#source-104840-104878">今の娘に感激の無いのは、</seg></p>
