        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-105429-105488"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105429-105450"><rb>落葉</rb><rt>おちば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105450-105465">して人目に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105465-105477"><rb>附</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105477-105488">きぬ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105488-105532"><seg source="#source-105488-105506">わが庭の高き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105506-105527"><rb>木末</rb><rt>こずゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105527-105532">に</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105532-105567"><seg source="#source-105532-105567">小鳥の巣一つ懸かれり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105567-105602"><seg source="#source-105567-105602">飛び去りて鳥の影無し、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105602-105640"><seg source="#source-105602-105640">小鳥の巣、霜の置くのみ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105640-105694"><seg source="#source-105640-105661">小鳥の巣、日の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105661-105676"><rb>照</rb><rt>てら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105676-105694">すのみ。</seg></p>
        </div>
