          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-105782-105844"><seg source="#source-105782-105788">我が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105788-105809"><rb>藤子</rb><rt>ふぢこ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105809-105827"><rb>九</rb><rt>ここの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105827-105844">つながら、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105844-105873"><seg source="#source-105844-105873">小学の級長ながら、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105873-105932"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105873-105891"><rb>夜更</rb><rt>よふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105891-105906">けては独り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105906-105924"><rb>目覚</rb><rt>めざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105924-105932">めて</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105932-105982"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105932-105953"><rb>寝台</rb><rt>ねだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-105953-105982">より親を呼ぶなり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-105982-106041">「お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-105988-106009"><rb>蒲団</rb><rt>ふとん</rt></ruby>がまた落ちました。」</p>
          <p source="#source-106041-106091"><seg source="#source-106041-106047">我が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-106047-106068"><rb>藤子</rb><rt>ふぢこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-106068-106091">風引くなかれ。</seg></p>
