          <p source="#source-178804-178856"><seg source="#source-178804-178828">笑つた口のやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-178828-178843"><rb>紅</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-178843-178856">い花。</seg></p>
