          <p source="#source-180433-180471"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180433-180448"><rb>眩</rb><rt>まば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180448-180471">ゆくも変りゆく</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-180471-180502"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180471-180489"><rb>焔</rb><rt>ほのほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180489-180502">の舞。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-180502-180555"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180502-180523"><rb>曙</rb><rt>あけぼの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180523-180526">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180526-180547"><rb>雲間</rb><rt>くもま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180547-180555">から</seg></p>
