          <p source="#source-180605-180646"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180605-180626"><rb>真赤</rb><rt>まつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180626-180646">に染めて笑ふ</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-180646-180668"><seg source="#source-180646-180668">地上の山山。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-180668-180724"><seg source="#source-180668-180674">今、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180674-180692"><rb>焔</rb><rt>ほのほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180692-180695">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180695-180710"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180710-180724">揺れし、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-180724-180771"><seg source="#source-180724-180742">世界に降らす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-180742-180766"><rb>金粉</rb><rt>きんぷん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-180766-180771">。</seg></p>
