          <p source="#source-181120-181137"><seg source="#source-181120-181137">春が来た。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181137-181193"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181137-181158"><rb>亜鉛</rb><rt>とたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181158-181193">の屋根に、ちよちよと、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181193-181237"><seg source="#source-181193-181199">妻に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181199-181214"><rb>焦</rb><rt>こが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181214-181237">れてまんまろな</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181237-181298"><seg source="#source-181237-181246">ふくら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181246-181264"><rb>雀</rb><rt>すゞめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181264-181273">もよい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181273-181291"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181291-181298">。</seg></p>
