        <div>
          <p source="#source-181702-181716"><seg source="#source-181702-181716">春よ春、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181716-181748"><seg source="#source-181716-181748">街に来てゐる春よ春、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181748-181785"><seg source="#source-181748-181785">横顔さへもなぜ見せぬ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181785-181799"><seg source="#source-181785-181799">春よ春、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181799-181846"><seg source="#source-181799-181805">うす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181805-181820"><rb>衣</rb><rt>ぎぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181820-181846">すらもはおらずに</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181846-181892"><seg source="#source-181846-181861">二月の肌を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181861-181876"><rb>惜</rb><rt>をし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181876-181892">むのか。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181892-181918"><seg source="#source-181892-181898">早く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181898-181910"><rb>注</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181910-181918">せ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181918-181962"><seg source="#source-181918-181924">あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181924-181948"><rb>大川</rb><rt>おほかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181948-181962">に紫を、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-181962-182014"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-181962-181980"><rb>其処</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-181980-182014">の並木にうすべにを。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182014-182028"><seg source="#source-182014-182028">春よ春、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182028-182063"><seg source="#source-182028-182063">そなたの肌のぬくもりを</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182063-182127"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182063-182087"><rb>微風</rb><rt>そよかぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182087-182096">として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182096-182111"><rb>軒</rb><rt>のき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182111-182127">に置け。</seg></p>
