          <p source="#source-182144-182230"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182144-182165"><rb>屹度</rb><rt>きつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182165-182168">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182168-182183"><rb>蜜</rb><rt>みつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182183-182186">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182186-182198"><rb>香</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182198-182201">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182201-182219"><rb>薔薇</rb><rt>ばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182219-182230">の夢、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182230-182276"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182230-182245"><rb>乳</rb><rt>ちゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182245-182276">のやうなる雨の糸。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182276-182302"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182276-182291"><rb>想</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182291-182302">ふさへ</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182302-182349"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-182302-182314"><rb>好</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-182314-182349">しや、そなたの贈り物、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182349-182383"><seg source="#source-182349-182383">そして恋する赤い時。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182383-182397"><seg source="#source-182383-182397">春よ春、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182397-182435"><seg source="#source-182397-182435">おお、横顔をちらと見た。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-182435-182471"><seg source="#source-182435-182471">緑の雪が散りかかる。</seg></p>
