          <p source="#source-185053-185097"><seg source="#source-185053-185077">わけて柳のさばき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-185077-185092"><rb>髪</rb><rt>がみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-185092-185097">、</seg></p>
