          <p source="#source-185477-185533"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-185477-185492"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-185492-185498">やら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-185498-185513"><rb>軽</rb><rt>かろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-185513-185533">く、人ごみに</seg></p>
