          <p source="#source-199816-199842"><seg source="#source-199816-199842">われに親しきは、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-199842-199868"><seg source="#source-199842-199868">肉身の深き底より</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-199868-199909"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-199868-199880"><rb>已</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-199880-199886">むに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-199886-199898"><rb>已</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-199898-199909">まれず</seg></p>
