          <p source="#source-200009-200080"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200009-200021"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200021-200039">れにひとしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200039-200054"><rb>紅</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200054-200057">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200057-200075"><rb>薔薇</rb><rt>ばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200075-200080">、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200080-200118"><seg source="#source-200080-200089">はた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200089-200113"><rb>逸早</rb><rt>いちはや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200113-200118">く</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200118-200153"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200118-200136"><rb>愁</rb><rt>うれひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200136-200153">を知るや、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200153-200170"><seg source="#source-200153-200170">青ざめて、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200170-200214"><seg source="#source-200170-200191">月の光に似たる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200191-200209"><rb>薔薇</rb><rt>ばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200209-200214">、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200214-200252"><seg source="#source-200214-200235">深き疑惑に沈み</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200235-200247"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200247-200252">る</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-200252-200311"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200252-200279"><rb>烏羽玉</rb><rt>うはたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200279-200288">の黒き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-200288-200306"><rb>薔薇</rb><rt>ばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-200306-200311">。</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-200311-200327"><seg source="#source-200311-200327">×</seg></p>
