          <p source="#source-201687-201734"><seg source="#source-201687-201696">人間の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201696-201720"><rb>花季</rb><rt>はなどき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201720-201734">は短い、</seg></p>
