          <p source="#source-201877-201927"><seg source="#source-201877-201889">そなたを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201889-201907"><rb>陰影</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-201907-201927">の中に置く。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-201927-201956"><seg source="#source-201927-201956">それは、あの太陽に</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-201956-201997"><seg source="#source-201956-201997">そなたを奪はせないためだ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-201997-202044"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-201997-202012"><rb>猶</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202012-202044">、自分を守るやうに、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202044-202086"><seg source="#source-202044-202086">そなたを守りたいためだ。</seg></p>
