        <div>
          <p source="#source-202165-202218"><seg source="#source-202165-202174">おお、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202174-202195"><rb>真赤</rb><rt>まつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202195-202218">なる神秘の花、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202218-202259"><seg source="#source-202218-202233">天啓の花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202233-202254"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202254-202259">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202259-202288"><seg source="#source-202259-202288">ひとり地上にありて</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202288-202350"><seg source="#source-202288-202324">かの太陽の心を知れる花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202324-202345"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202345-202350">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202350-202440"><seg source="#source-202350-202362">愛の花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202362-202429"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-24360-176-8" source="#source-202362-202417">𤍠</g></rb><rt>ねつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202429-202440">の花、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202440-202508"><seg source="#source-202440-202455">幻想の花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202455-202473"><rb>焔</rb><rt>ほのほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202473-202482">の花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202482-202503"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202503-202508">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202508-202552"><seg source="#source-202508-202552">コンテツス・ド・ノワイユを、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202552-202617"><seg source="#source-202552-202573">ルノワアルを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202573-202609"><rb>梅蘭芳</rb><rt>メイランフワン</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202609-202617">を、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202617-202711"><seg source="#source-202617-202623">梅原</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202623-202662"><rb>龍三郎</rb><rt>りようざぶらう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202662-202683">を連想する花、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202683-202704"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202704-202711">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202711-202746"><seg source="#source-202711-202746">おお、そなたは、また、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202746-202796"><seg source="#source-202746-202767">宇宙の不思議に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202767-202779"><rb>酔</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202779-202796">へる哲人の</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202796-202897"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202796-202829"><rb>大歓喜</rb><rt>だいくわんぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202829-202838">を示す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202838-202868"><rb>記号</rb><rt>アンブレエム</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202868-202871">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202871-202892"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202892-202897">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202897-202929"><seg source="#source-202897-202929">また詩人が常に建つる</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-202929-203040"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202929-203008"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-24360-176-5" source="#source-202929-202984">𤍠</g><seg source="#source-202984-202987">情</seg></rb><rt>ねつじやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203008-203011">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203011-203035"><rb>宝楼</rb><rt>はうろう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203035-203040">の</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-203040-203189"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203040-203067"><rb>柱頭</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-203067-203139"><lem>ちゆうとう</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-203121-203133">ちうとう</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203139-203163">を飾る火焔模様、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203163-203184"><rb>牡丹</rb><rt>ぼたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203184-203189">。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-203189-203242"><seg source="#source-203189-203207">また、青春の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203207-203231"><rb>秘経</rb><rt>ひきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203231-203242">の奥に</seg></p>
