            <head n="2" source="#source-212621-212663"><seg source="#source-212621-212627">夏草</seg></head>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-212667-212705"><seg source="#source-212667-212673">庭に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212673-212688"><rb>繁</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212688-212705">れる雑草も</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-212705-212743"><seg source="#source-212705-212743">見る人によりあはれなり、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-212743-212796"><seg source="#source-212743-212749">心に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212749-212764"><rb>上</rb><rt>のぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212764-212767">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212767-212791"><rb>雑念</rb><rt>ざふねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212791-212796">も</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-212796-212849"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212796-212820"><rb>一一</rb><rt><seg source="#source-212805-212811">いち</seg><choice source="#source-212811-212817"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212820-212849">見れば捨てがたし。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-212849-212887"><seg source="#source-212849-212887">あはれなり、捨てがたし、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-212887-212929"><seg source="#source-212887-212929">捨てがたし、あはれなり。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-212929-213020" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-212950-213016"><seg source="#source-212950-212968">たんぽぽの穂</seg></head>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-213020-213073"><seg source="#source-213020-213038">うすずみ色の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213038-213065"><rb>梅雨空</rb><rt>つゆぞら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213065-213073">に、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213073-213111"><seg source="#source-213073-213111">屋根の上から、ふわふわと</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213111-213199"><seg source="#source-213111-213126">たんぽぽの</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-213132-213180"><lem><seg source="#source-213126-213132">穂が</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-213168-213174">穂か</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-213180-213199">白く散る。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213199-213289"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213199-213266"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-24360-184-2" source="#source-213199-213254">𤍠</g></rb><rt>ねつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213266-213289">と笑ひを失つた</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213289-213336"><seg source="#source-213289-213307">老いた世界の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213307-213331"><rb>肌皮</rb><rt>はだかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213331-213336">が</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213336-213388"><seg source="#source-213336-213345">枯れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213345-213357"><rb>剥</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213357-213388">がれて落ちるのか。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213388-213429"><seg source="#source-213388-213429">たんぽぽの穂の散るままに、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213429-213491"><seg source="#source-213429-213438">ちらと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213438-213456"><rb>滑稽</rb><rt>おど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213456-213462">けた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213462-213486"><rb>骸骨</rb><rt>がいこつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213486-213491">が</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213491-213537"><seg source="#source-213491-213515">前に踊つて消えて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213515-213527"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213527-213537">く。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213537-213581"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213537-213552"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213552-213581">か心の無かるべき。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213581-213631"><seg source="#source-213581-213590">ほつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213590-213608"><rb>気息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213608-213631">をばつきながら</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213631-213669"><seg source="#source-213631-213669">思ひあまりて散るならん、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-213669-213792"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213669-213687"><rb>梅雨</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-213687-213744"><lem>つゆ</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-213732-213738">づゆ</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213744-213747">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213747-213768"><rb>晴間</rb><rt>はれま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213768-213792">の屋根の草。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-213792-213871" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
          <div>
