          <p source="#source-253939-253983"><seg source="#source-253939-253954">秋の盛りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253954-253969"><rb>美</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-253969-253983">くしや、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-253983-254193"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253983-254167"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-91-43" source="#source-253983-254090">蘩</g><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-91-21" source="#source-254090-254152">蔞</g></rb><rt>はこべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254167-254193">の葉さへ小さなる</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254193-254264"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254193-254214"><rb>黄金</rb><rt>こがね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254214-254217">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254217-254232"><rb>印</rb><rt>いん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254232-254244">をあまた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254244-254256"><rb>佩</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254256-254264">び、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254264-254385"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254264-254291"><rb>野葡萄</rb><rt>のぶだう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254291-254300">さへも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254300-254318"><rb>瑠璃</rb><rt>るり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254318-254321">を</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-254330-254381"><lem><seg source="#source-254321-254330">掛く。</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-254369-254375">掛く</seg></rdg></app></p>
          <p source="#source-254385-254501"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254385-254403"><rb>百舌</rb><rt>もず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254403-254406">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254406-254421"><rb>鶸</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-254421-254478"><lem>ひは</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-254466-254472">ひよ</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254478-254501">も肥えまさり、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254501-254542"><seg source="#source-254501-254507">里の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254507-254525"><rb>雀</rb><rt>すゞめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254525-254542">も鳥らしく</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254542-254580"><seg source="#source-254542-254580">晴れたる空に群れて飛び、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254580-254641"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254580-254595"><rb>蜂</rb><rt>はち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254595-254598">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254598-254619"><rb>巣毎</rb><rt>すごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254619-254641">に子の歌ふ。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254641-254691"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254641-254671"><rb>小豆色</rb><rt>あづきいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254671-254691">する房垂れて</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254691-254738"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254691-254715"><rb>鶏頭</rb><rt>けいとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254715-254738">高く咲く庭に、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254738-254794"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254738-254753"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254753-254762">しきり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254762-254774"><rb>射</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254774-254794">す日の入りも</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-254794-254842"><seg source="#source-254794-254815">涙ぐむまで身に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-254815-254827"><rb>沁</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-254827-254842">みぬ。</seg></p>
